OL,3,CIndonesian ferry fire leaves at least
OL,4,Cfive dead and dozens missing
OL,6,FAn Indonesian ferry carrying 271
OL,7,Fpeople caught fire in waters off the
OL,8,Fmain island of Java on Sunday, leaving
OL,9,Fat least five people dead and dozens
OL,10,Fmissing as rescuers and passing
OL,11,Fvessels evacuated hundreds from the
OL,12,Fburning ship, officials said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
