OL,3,CIndonesian ferry fire leaves at least
OL,4,Cfive dead and dozens missing
OL,6,FThe Mutiara Sentosa 2 ferry was
OL,7,Ftravelling from Indonesia's second-
OL,8,Flargest city of Surabaya in East Java
OL,9,Fto the city of Makassar in South
OL,10,FSulawesi, with 232 passengers and 39
OL,11,Fcrew members, when the fire broke out
OL,12,Fbetween 6 am and 7 am in waters off
OL,13,FSumenep regency, according to
OL,14,FIndonesia's National Search and Rescue
OL,15,FAgency, or Basarnas.
OL,17,FThe ferry operator, PT Atosim Lampung
OL,18,FPelayaran, reported the incident to
OL,19,Fthe Surabaya search and rescue office
OL,20,Fabout an hour later, Basarnas said in
OL,21,Fa statement.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
