CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785707279
OL,3,CIndonesian ferry fire leaves at least
OL,4,Cfive dead and dozens missing
OL,6,FIt said the company received
OL,7,Finformation from the ferry's captain
OL,8,Fthat the vessel was on fire near the
OL,9,Fnorthern tip of Madura island, but
OL,10,Fcontact was later lost.
OL,12,FBy 9.45 am, authorities determined the
OL,13,Fferry was about 19 nautical miles
OL,14,Fnorth of Buruan Sapudi island after
OL,15,Fcommunicating with the nearby cargo
OL,16,Fvessel Meratus Project 3, which was
OL,17,Funable to approach the burning vessel
OL,18,Fclosely because it was carrying a
OL,19,Fflammable load.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
