PN,31004
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785707279
OL,3,CIndonesian ferry fire leaves at least
OL,4,Cfive dead and dozens missing
OL,6,FFootage released by the National
OL,7,FSearch and Rescue Agency showed thick
OL,8,Fblack smoke billowing from one side of
OL,9,Fthe ferry and spreading across much of
OL,10,Fthe ship, while videos circulating on
OL,11,Fsocial media and messaging groups
OL,12,Fshowed terrified passengers, mostly
OL,13,Fwearing life jackets, could be seen
OL,14,Fclustered on the deck and upper
OL,15,Fsections of the vessel awaiting
OL,16,Frescue, some jumping into the sea as
OL,17,Forange flames and black smoke billowed
OL,18,Ffrom the burning vessel.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
