PN,31005
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785707279
OL,3,CIndonesian ferry fire leaves at least
OL,4,Cfive dead and dozens missing
OL,6,FThe ferry was reported to be nearly
OL,7,Fengulfed by flames, with passengers
OL,8,Fgathered on the bridge and bow. A
OL,9,Ftugboat and another passing vessel
OL,10,Fmoved in and began evacuating
OL,11,Fpassengers shortly before 10 am, the
OL,12,Fstatement said.
OL,14,FBy Sunday afternoon, several nearby
OL,15,Fvessels managed to rescue 225
OL,16,Fpassengers and crew and recovered five
OL,17,Fbodies. At least 41 people remained
OL,18,Funaccounted for.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/8
