OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785707279
OL,3,CIndonesian ferry fire leaves at least
OL,4,Cfive dead and dozens missing
OL,6,FSearch and rescue teams dispatched a
OL,7,Frescue vessel from Surabaya, although
OL,8,Fofficials estimated it would take
OL,9,Fabout six hours to reach the scene. A
OL,10,Frigid inflatable boat from the Sumenep
OL,11,Frescue post was sent toward the
OL,12,Flocation but later returned to shore
OL,13,Fbecause of rough seas and high waves.
OL,14,FThe Indonesian Navy also deployed a
OL,15,Fwarship to assist.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/8
