CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785707279
OL,3,CIndonesian ferry fire leaves at least
OL,4,Cfive dead and dozens missing
OL,6,FThe 160 metres long and 25 metres wide
OL,7,Fferry serves the Surabaya-Makassar
OL,8,Froute, a voyage that typically takes
OL,9,Faround 40 hours and is primarily used
OL,10,Fby domestic travellers and cargo
OL,11,Ftransport between Java and Sulawesi.
OL,13,FIndonesia is an archipelago of more
OL,14,Fthan 17,000 islands where ferries are
OL,15,Fa common method of travel. Disasters
OL,16,Foccur regularly, with weak safety
OL,17,Fenforcement often blamed.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/8
